      "description": "Founder and CEO of Surmado, building managed AI systems for small businesses. Independent researcher on authorship and answerability. Musician and producer; Scoobert Doobert is his primary music project, and he is half of FEiN with Brandon Woodward. Host of Love Music More. Based in San Diego.",
